bluejetty:00177654:ios.description:
Play your favourite “Find the Difference” Game!
New design. New author's levels. Regular seasonal events. The game is 100% free. 
It trains your attention and stimulates your brain. 
We tried to take all the best from the first part, created a unique one that includes the main favourite mechanics of finding differences between two pictures and supplemented it with contrasting and diverse content. Everything is done to make the process of the game interesting, and you couldn’t tear yourself away! Have fun playing with the whole family and friends!
Different levels of difficulty and speed of searching for objects, and if you suddenly want something simpler - just use the zoom or hints!
A short guide on how to play:
1. Find 5 differences in two pictures in a limited time;
2. As you find the differences - click on them as quickly as possible to meet the given time and go to the next level;
3. You can choose what you want today: pass the main levels, or pass daily challenges;
4. You can also find a new adventure for yourself by completing seasonal events that you will see on the main screen!
Game highlights:
- Daily Challenges, Events, Bonus levels;
- Easy to play;
- Tons of levels, daily content updates;
- Automatic online progress save;
- Zoom and hints to help you find tricky differences;
- Doesn’t require a large amount of space on the device;
- Tutorial - learn how to play on the first level;
- Suitable for iPhone, iPad and iPod
This is a simple, rich and dynamic game that will allow you to keep your concentration in good shape, quietly spend your free time in pleasure and get a charge of good mood for the whole day!
If you are a fan of hidden objects, spot the difference and puzzle games, then this will be the perfect choice for you!
Hurry up to download, we are waiting for you to become a part of the family!
SUBSCRIPTION PRICING AND TERMS:
• Subscription: $4.99 weekly subscription for adding unlimited hints, removing ads and getting daily content.
• The price is for US customers. Pricing in other countries may vary and actual charges may be converted to your local currency depending on the country of residence.
• Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase.
• Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period.
• Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal.
• Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user's Account Settings after purchase.
• Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication, where applicable.
Privacy Policy: https://www.cleverside.com/privacy/
Terms of use: https://www.cleverside.com/terms/

